# SHA-256 of `serde_json::to_vec(&records)` over one replay of
# coinbase-20s.jsonl - see tests/replay_coinbase.rs::replay_is_deterministic.
#
# Golden value for "same input, same bytes out". It changes only when the
# fixture changes or a record's shape changes; either way the new value goes
# here with a line saying what moved. It is not a hash of the fixture file.
#
# 2026-08-26  first recorded: ATOM-USD, 159 frames, sequence_num 0..158 with
#             0 gaps, 1 market_trades frame (100 trades), 16 snapshots. The
#             level2 snapshot event is trimmed to 1,250 of 3,440 levels (all
#             450 bids, best 800 offers) to keep the file under 400 KB.
